## File 2: `plan/reports/phase-09-sdk-paths-fix.md`

**Title:** Implementation Report — Fix SDK ConsiliumPaths After Phase 09  
**Date:** 2026-07-27  
**Summary:** A narrower-scope report focusing specifically on the SDK path issue (Bug 6 above). Phase 09 updated the Python CLI but missed `agent_sdk/paths.ts` in the extension repo. The SDK's `ConsiliumPaths.sessionDir()` still returned the old hashed path `~/.consilium/sessions/{md5hash}/{id}`, while the CLI now writes to `{workDir}/.consilium/sessions/regular/{id}`. Fix updated three functions (`sessionsDir`, `sessionDir`, `baselineDir`) to workspace-local format and removed the `hashPath()` dependency.

